# OAuth client ID from Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Credentials
# -> Create credentials -> OAuth client ID -> Web application.
# Add your origin (e.g. http://localhost:5173) to "Authorised JavaScript origins".
#
# You can also paste the client ID into Settings inside the app at runtime,
# which is stored in localStorage and does not need a rebuild.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
